  "description": "A production-grade .NET 9.0 tool providing a safe SQL execution API for PostgreSQL/Supabase. Built with ASP.NET Core, featuring comprehensive security guardrails, audit logging, and high-performance JSON serialization. Perfect for AI assistants (Claude, ChatGPT), automation tools, and applications that need controlled database access.",
