  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of PostgreTool v1.0.0\n\nOpen Source: Licensed under Apache License 2.0 - free for commercial use, modification, and distribution.\n\nFeatures:\n- Safe SQL execution API for PostgreSQL/Supabase with comprehensive security guardrails\n- Read-only queries (SELECT, WITH, EXPLAIN) and write operations (INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY)\n- Automatic LIMIT injection for unbounded queries\n- Schema allowlisting and statement validation\n- Complete audit logging with structured logs\n- Parameterized query support\n- Built-in timeouts and result size limits\n- Designed for AI assistants (Claude, ChatGPT) and automation tools\n- .NET 9.0 with high-performance JSON serialization\n\nSecurity:\n- Blocks dangerous operations (DROP, ALTER, TRUNCATE, GRANT, REVOKE)\n- Works with restricted database roles (no superuser required)\n- Row Level Security (RLS) compatible\n- Defense-in-depth security model\n\nDeployment:\n- Available as .NET Global Tool\n- Docker and Kubernetes ready\n- Production-grade logging with Serilog",
